# Docs

When you add or edit markdown or a cursor rule, run `npm run docs:check` and fix every dead link it prints.

When you add a folder, a script, or an environment variable, update the project structure tree in `README.md`, the test table in `DEVELOP.md`, and the environment-variable table in `DEVELOP.md`.

Never put a Firebase project id, a secret, a token, or real transaction data in docs. Use placeholders such as `<your-project-id>`.

Do not write API docs until [ADR 0006](../../docs/adr/0006-external-write-api.md) is Accepted.
